<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS BEAT NEWCASTLE 3-2 IN PRE-SEASON FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS BEAT NEWCASTLE 3-2 IN PRE-SEASON FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>CESENA, Italy 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a pre-season</p>
<p>soccer friendly played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Juventus (Italy)  3  Newcastle (England)  2</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Juventus - Ciro Ferrara 1, Filippo Inzaghi 2, 34</p>
<p>Newcastle - Faustino Asprilla 69 pen, 82</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000.</p>
</text>
